WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.202
Temporal preparation remains important in Spark.

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:07.387
Parse raw strings into typed dates or timestamps.

00:00:07.387 --> 00:00:12.142
Use Spark S Q L date functions appropriate to that environment.

00:00:12.142 --> 00:00:14.702
And always state the output grain.

00:00:14.702 --> 00:00:19.314
For example, one row per event is different from one row per month.
